### Vulnerability Details
The vulnerability lies in the fact that 
1. the `CuratorRewardsDistributor::deposit` function lacks access control, enabling just any user make a function call and send ether in the process which cannot be retrieved or withdrawn by the user. See https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-08-phi/blob/8c0985f7a10b231f916a51af5d506dd6b0c54120/src/reward/CuratorRewardsDistributor.sol#L68-L75
