Since the `CuratorRewardsDistributor::deposit` function does not take note of depositors and the corresponding deposited amounts, it implies that if a user calls this function with some ether, their funds are lost. Besides that, the `CuratorRewardsDistributor` contract has no function that will enable a user to withdraw funds that were mistakenly deposited into the contract using the `CuratorRewardsDistributor::deposit` function.


